{"title":"What are events?","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"What are events?"},"headingText":"Defining events in analytics","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n\nAn event is a record of something that happened at a specific point in time.\nEvery click, transaction, sensor reading, or status change can be captured as\nan event.\n\n## Anatomy of an event\n\nAt minimum, an event has:\n\n- **Timestamp** — when it happened\n- **Type** — what kind of event (e.g., `page_view`, `purchase`, `alert`)\n- **Payload** — the data associated with the event\n\n```{r}\n#| label: event-example\n#| echo: true\n\nevent <- list(\n  timestamp = Sys.time(),\n  type = \"page_view\",\n  payload = list(\n    user_id = \"u_12345\",\n    page = \"/dashboard\",\n    duration_seconds = 45\n  )\n)\n\nstr(event)\n```\n\n## Why events matter\n\nTraditional analytics asks \"what is the current state?\" Event analytics asks\n\"what happened, in what order, and why?\" This shift unlocks temporal analysis,\nfunnel tracking, and real-time monitoring.\n\n[Explore event data in the dashboard →](http://localhost:3838){.explore-cta}\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n## Defining events in analytics\n\nAn event is a record of something that happened at a specific point in time.\nEvery click, transaction, sensor reading, or status change can be captured as\nan event.\n\n## Anatomy of an event\n\nAt minimum, an event has:\n\n- **Timestamp** — when it happened\n- **Type** — what kind of event (e.g., `page_view`, `purchase`, `alert`)\n- **Payload** — the data associated with the event\n\n```{r}\n#| label: event-example\n#| echo: true\n\nevent <- list(\n  timestamp = Sys.time(),\n  type = \"page_view\",\n  payload = list(\n    user_id = \"u_12345\",\n    page = \"/dashboard\",\n    duration_seconds = 45\n  )\n)\n\nstr(event)\n```\n\n## Why events matter\n\nTraditional analytics asks \"what is the current state?\" Event analytics asks\n\"what happened, in what order, and why?\" This shift unlocks temporal analysis,\nfunnel tracking, and real-time monitoring.\n\n[Explore event data in the dashboard →](http://localhost:3838){.explore-cta}\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":false,"freeze":"auto","echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"knitr"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"show","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to":"html","toc":true,"toc-depth":3,"output-file":"what-are-events.html"},"language":{"toc-title-document":"Table of contents","toc-title-website":"On this page","related-formats-title":"Other Formats","related-notebooks-title":"Notebooks","source-notebooks-prefix":"Source","other-links-title":"Other Links","code-links-title":"Code Links","launch-dev-container-title":"Launch Dev Container","launch-binder-title":"Launch Binder","article-notebook-label":"Article Notebook","notebook-preview-download":"Download Notebook","notebook-